Package: l10n-conv
Version: 1.0.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-click, python3-polib, python3-babel, python3-lxml, python3-rich, python3-yaml
Maintainer: Daniel Nylander <daniel@danielnylander.se>
Description: Universal localization file converter, validator, and compiler
 l10n-conv converts, validates, and compiles localization files across 16+
 formats including Gettext PO/MO, Qt TS, XLIFF, Android XML, iOS Strings,
 JSON, YAML, CSV, TMX, TBX, PHP, ARB, Fluent, RESX, and Properties.
Homepage: https://github.com/yeager/l10n-conv
